A multi-line braced comment keeps the nested list open

```
- a
  - b
{% c
  d %}
  - c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>b
{% c
d %}</li>
      <li>c</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

